# Vite reads VITE_* env vars at build time and inlines them into the
# bundle as import.meta.env.VITE_*. Sentry DSNs are project identifiers,
# not authentication secrets — Sentry's docs explicitly say they can be
# committed and shipped in client-side bundles.
#
